 we can not every place in every  province in every village in every town  contest for the virus the number of  infections is surging the World Health  Organization is meeting for a second day  to try and get a grip on the virus do  you think that because there's so much  global pressure this  sort of blow things open a little bit in  China it's awfully hard to keep a lid on  things like this for a while the global  community wants to know the World Health  Organization wants to know this is no  longer just a problem of China it's a  problem for the world according to the  nonprofit organization Chinese human  rights defenders more than 350 Chinese  citizens have been either detained or  fined for simply discussing the epidemic  online attorney  all right Debora patta forests in Hong  Kong Deborah thank you very much
 

